{"id": "191176", "name": "אינטגרל כפול של 1+f_x²+f_y² על מלבן – f ריבועית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>עבור הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( f(x,y)={{CT:0}} \\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( D={{CT:1}} \\times{{CT:2}} \\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle{\\iint_D 1+\\left(f'_x(x,y)\\right)^2+\\left(f'_y(x,y)\\right)^2\\, dxdy}=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחשבים את הנגזרות החלקיות ואת האינטגרנד, ואז את האינטגרל החוזר על המלבן: קודם לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ואחר כך לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרות החלקיות</b><br>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x,y)={{CT:0}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'_x={{CT:3}},\\qquad f'_y={{CT:4}} \\]</p>ולכן האינטגרנד הוא<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 1+\\left(f'_x\\right)^2+\\left(f'_y\\right)^2={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — האינטגרל הפנימי</b><br>התחום הוא המלבן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D={{CT:1}}\\times{{CT:2}}\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}\\le x\\le {{CT:7}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:8}}\\le y\\le {{CT:9}}\\)</span>. על מלבן הגבולות קבועים, ואפשר לבצע את האינטגרציה בכל סדר. נתחיל לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> קבוע):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_{{{CT:6}}}^{{{CT:7}}}\\left({{CT:5}}\\right)dx={{CT:10}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — האינטגרל החיצוני</b><br>עכשיו לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_{{{CT:8}}}^{{{CT:9}}}\\left({{CT:10}}\\right)dy={{CT:11}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\iint_D 1+\\left(f'_x\\right)^2+\\left(f'_y\\right)^2\\,dx\\,dy={{CT:11}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sol", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Correct answer!</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\iint_D 1+\\left(f'_x(x,y)\\right)^2+\\left(f'_y(x,y)\\right)^2\\, dxdy= \\int_{{{CT:8}}}^{{{CT:9}}}\\left ({ \\int_{{{CT:6}}}^{{{CT:7}}}{{{CT:12}}}}dx \\right )dy={{CT:11}} \\)</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Incorrect answer!</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\( \\iint_D 1+\\left(f'_x(x,y)\\right)^2+\\left(f'_y(x,y)\\right)^2\\, dxdy= \\int_{{{CT:8}}}^{{{CT:9}}}\\left ({ \\int_{{{CT:6}}}^{{{CT:7}}}{{{CT:12}}}}dx \\right )dy={{CT:11}} \\)</p></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["STACK_PLOT_UNIQUE_NUMBER", "a", "b", "c", "d", "e", "f", "fx", "fy", "g", "g1", "g2", "gx", "m", "p", "q", "s", "sol", "t", "xrec", "yrec"], "nvariants": 50}